      "content": "social media or the news... people just want to watch the chaos, they dont actually care about the paperwork. it feels like i'm just fighting to exist in a system that's already deleted me. i'm so tired of trying to prove i'm real to people who don't even see me. if the system has already decided i don't exist, why am i even bothering to keep trying to fight it? it's like... there's no dignity left in being a ghost in a machine that won't stop grinding you down.",
